* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Git's built-in markdown userdiff driver puts the enclosing heading in every @@ hunk
# header, including GitHub's PR view. It also makes `git grep -W` and
# `git log -L :'^### D-57':docs/DecisionLog.md` work on the docs.
*.md diff=markdown

# DecisionLog.md is append-only by its own rule, so two branches adding D-80 and D-81
# conflict on every concurrent append. Union merge takes both sides.
docs/DecisionLog.md merge=union
